OL,3,GNEWSATeens killed rival dealer in turf
OL,4,Awar, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo teenagers used a 30cm (12IN) knife
OL,7,Fto fatally stab a rival drug dealer in
OL,8,Fa city centre park, a court has heard.
OL,10,FRadwan Shakur, 21, died after being
OL,11,Fstabbed through the heart in Central
OL,12,FPark, Chelmsford, on 12 June.
OL,14,FA jury at Chelmsford Crown Court was
OL,15,Ftold the murder was the result of a
OL,16,F"turf war between drug dealers".
OL,18,FBlaise Mfinda, 18, of Widford Chase,
OL,19,FChelmsford, and an unnamed 17-year-old
OL,20,Fboy both deny murder, with Mfinda also
OL,21,Fdenying possession of a knife in a
OL,22,Fpublic place.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
